  "_doc": "Seed evaluation set: English sentences with reference ASL glosses written to common ASL gloss conventions (ME/YOU/IX-3 pronouns, fs- for fingerspelling, FINISH for completed action). References were NOT tuned to the system's rules and some alternatives are equally valid ASL, so scores are a lower bound. IMPORTANT: have these references reviewed by a fluent/Deaf ASL signer before reporting them in the paper.",
